The Athame isn't really all that special a weapon.  However it
has another neat feature: It can engrave very well without ever
becoming dull.

"So what?" you ask.  Well Engraving can be a huge help with wimpy
character.  If you engrave the word "Elbereth" (from Tolkien), 
monsters will not step on that space.

This allows you to stand on the space an not have any monsters attack
you.  There are a few things to watch out for.  Some monsters can
step on that space (I think all @ monsters).  They can also throw
things at you, and can also breath attacks at you.  You can also
rub the word out eventually if you stand on it and attack monsters.
